          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "শাসন করা (shāsôn kôrā) puts Sanskrit śāsana, 'chastising; teaching; an order' (Monier-Williams), before করা. It shares its root with শাসানো, to threaten, and শাস্তি, a punishment."
            }
